  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.Logging provider for ZipLogger. Add with builder.Logging.AddZipLogger(...) — structured logs, scopes, and exceptions ship to your ZipLogger server in the background. Sign up free at https://ziplogger.dev. Registers IEventTracker too, so Track()/Identify() for product-analytics events are injectable alongside logging, sharing one queue and connection.",
